  "title": "Your iPhone fires *30,000 dots* at your face 👀",
  "pronounce": {
    "3D": "three D"
  },
  "aspect": "1:1",
  "gap": 0.05,
  "hook": {
    "lines": [
      "Every time you unlock your iPhone,",
      "it fires *30,000 dots* at your face."
    ],
    "clips": [
      "f_ir_grid",
      "f_ir_grid2"
    ],
    "annotate": [
      {
        "type": "arrow",
        "at": "line2",
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5,
        "angle": 30
      }
    ],
    "sfx": [
      {
        "id": "boom",
        "at": "word:dots"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "lines": [
        "They're *infrared*,",
        "so your eyes can't see them."
      ],
      "clip": "f_girl"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "But an infrared camera *can*."
      ],
      "clip": "f_ir_face",
      "punch": true
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Those dots map your face in *3D*…"
      ],
      "clip": "f_mesh"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "…and a secure chip checks it",
        "against the face you saved."
      ],
      "clips": [
        "f_face1",
        "f_face2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "That's why a flat *photo* of you",
        "won't unlock it."
      ],
      "clip": "f_phone_shown"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Apple says the odds a stranger gets in:",
        "*1 in a million*."
      ],
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "ding",
          "at": "line2"
        }
      ],
      "clip": "card_odds"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "But here's the *twist*…"
      ],
      "pause_after": 0.3,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "dun_dun",
          "at": "start",
          "gain": -5,
          "dur": 2.0
        }
      ],
      "clip": "f_eyes"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Those odds get *worse*",
        "for identical twins."
      ],
      "clip": "f_twins",
      "punch": true,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "boom",
          "at": "word:twins"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "In tests, some twins have unlocked",
        "each other's phones."
      ],
      "clips": [
        "f_twin_try",
        "f_twin_show"
      ],
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "no_way",
          "at": "end",
          "gain": -4
        }
      ],
      "pause_after": 1.0
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Apple's own advice?",
        "If you're worried, use a *passcode*."
      ],
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "click",
          "at": "word:passcode"
        }
      ],
      "clips": [
        "f_apple",
        "f_combo_lock"
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Do *you* have a twin? 👯"
      ],
      "clip": "f_twins2"
    }
  ],
